{"id": "1546439388375023727", "channel_id": "1546439388375023727", "author_id": "1470253170209853632", "author_name": "morimensstaff03", "content": "守密人你好：\n       弥萨格大学校务处将于9月7日16:35(UTC+8) 进行校内设施修复，更新完成后您将得到通知，重新进入游戏。对于更新可能给大家带来的不便，我们会准备一份补给物资以示歉意。祝大家调查顺利！ \n       更新内容中，末尾标注 ☆ 的事项来自社区各位守密人的问题反馈。感谢各位守密人的耐心与帮助！\n  \n【补给物资】\n在线维护补偿：银芯×50\n  \n【领取条件】\n领取时间截至2026年9月21日23:59。请记得及时前往邮箱领取补给物资哦。  \n \n【更新内容】\n\n一、活动\n● 更新后至 9 月 21 日 9:00 期间，限定 SSR 命轮「诗笺的句尾」将开启限时免费回溯。\n\n二、战斗\n● 下调了「融灾禁区·困难」和「融灾禁区·噩梦」敌人的强度：「融灾禁区·困难」敌人生命下调约 20~50%，伤害下降约 7%~11%，「融灾禁区·噩梦」敌人生命下调约 5~15%，伤害下降约 1%~2%。\n\n三、问题修复\n● 修复了网络不稳定的情况下，在「星辰篇」规则关卡调查时，战斗结束后可能卡住的问题。\n● 修复了「版本体验调查问卷 V2.6.0」邮件中，「点击前往填写」点击后无法跳转到问卷的问题。", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:38:01.643000+00:00", "thread_id": "1546439388375023727", "reactions": [{"emoji": "🐘", "emoji_id": null, "count": 15}, {"emoji": "🚮", "emoji_id": null, "count": 4}], "attachments": [{"id": "1546439388831948862", "filename": "screenshot_2026-04-29_17-10-25.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 801524, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1546439388375023727/1546439388831948862/screenshot_2026-04-29_17-10-25.png?ex=6a9fc969&is=6a9e77e9&hm=b890011b2ecaa7352d10bfeeba43cf078b97989fa56b0b4bbb0ecc72bba2a690&"}], "thread_title": "V2.6.0.4 在线维护公告", "forum_channel_id": "1181135756958371881", "is_thread_starter": true}
{"id": "1546439488392400967", "channel_id": "1546439388375023727", "author_id": "1470253170209853632", "author_name": "morimensstaff03", "content": "**V2.6.0.4 Online Maintenance Announcement**\n\nDear Keeper,\nThe Mythag Administration Office will conduct campus facility maintenance on September 7, 2026 at 16:35(UTC+8) . You will be notified once the update is complete and you can re-enter the game. As an apology for any inconvenience caused by the update, we will provide a supply package. Wishing everyone a successful investigation!\nIn this update, items marked with ☆ at the end are based on feedback from Keepers in the community. Thank you all, Keepers, for your patience and support!\n   \n[Compensation]\nOnline Maintenance Compensation: Silver×50\n   \n[Claim Conditions]\nThe claiming time ends on September 21, 2026 at 23:59. Please remember to go to your mailox in time to claim the supply materials.\n   \n[Update Content]\n\nI. Event\n● From the update until September 21 at 9:00, the Limited SSR Wheel of Destiny \"The Last Verse\" will have a time-limited free Reset.\n\nII. Combat\n● Reduced the strength of enemies in \"D-Effect Zone·Hard\" and \"D-Effect Zone·Nightmare\": \"D-Effect Zone·Hard\" enemy HP reduced by approximately 20~50%, Damage reduced by approximately 7%~11%; \"D-Effect Zone·Nightmare\" enemy HP reduced by approximately 5~15%, Damage reduced by approximately 1%~2%.\n\n3. Bug Fixes\n● Fixed an issue where, under unstable network conditions, the game could get stuck after a battle during Stage investigation in \"Astral Reign\" rules.\n● Fixed an issue where clicking \"Go to Fill Out\" in the \"Version Experience Survey V2.6.0\" email failed to redirect to the survey.", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:38:25.489000+00:00", "thread_id": "1546439388375023727", "thread_title": "V2.6.0.4 在线维护公告", "forum_channel_id": "1181135756958371881"}
