{"id": "1546552289433751733", "channel_id": "1546552289433751733", "author_id": "1166632516136996886", "author_name": "morimensstaff02", "content": "守密人，\n    目前接到社区守密人反馈，发现部分情况下，调查关卡存在中途卡死的问题，目前校工正在定位问题原因并进行修复，对于该问题给守密人带来的不便，我们非常抱歉。\n    请守密人耐心等待，问题修复完成后，我们将按照实际影响情况发放对应的补给物资以表歉意。\n——✦——✦—— ✦✦✦ ——✦——✦——\nKeeper,\nWe have received feedback from community Keepers reporting that in some cases, investigation Stages may freeze midway through. Our team is currently working to identify The Reason for this issue and implement a fix. We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused to our Keepers.\nPlease be patient, Keeper. Once the issue has been resolved, we will distribute corresponding supply materials based on the actual impact as an expression of our apologies.", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T16:06:39.353000+00:00", "thread_id": "1546552289433751733", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Saya_wow", "emoji_id": "1513124172895879198", "count": 3}, {"emoji": "Hameln_love", "emoji_id": "1468257934348783749", "count": 2}, {"emoji": "Horla_cry", "emoji_id": "1357186646294138890", "count": 1}], "attachments": [{"id": "1546552290389921955", "filename": "lQDPJwvYGmhlHTPNAyDNBLCwUuNpTh4piMEFWSaXsTLvAA_1200_800.jpg", "content_type": "image/webp", "size": 60808, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1546552289433751733/1546552290389921955/lQDPJwvYGmhlHTPNAyDNBLCwUuNpTh4piMEFWSaXsTLvAA_1200_800.jpg?ex=6aa0328f&is=6a9ee10f&hm=7e9128c9bc60870e7c4d8c36ea32fb96cf640fd5f4fc0063db9d19b01e85cbbd&"}], "thread_title": "调查关卡卡死问题说明┊Investigation Stage Freeze Issue Description", "forum_channel_id": "1181135756958371881", "thread_tags": ["1181135885849346080", "1361342543970697397"], "is_thread_starter": true}
